[gd_scene load_steps=15 format=3 uid="uid://b2qrwm5pq8tcv"]

; Quarters furniture workbench — V3.
;
; Every furniture piece is a real instanced node — click in the Scene
; tree and drag with W (move) / E (rotate) / R (scale). Read the final
; Transform values off the Inspector and paste back to Claude to bake
; into RoomBuilder._accent_quarters.
;
; Bed switched to Kenney Space Station Kit's bed-single.OBJ (loaded as a
; Mesh resource into a MeshInstance3D). Nightstand + lamp removed —
; replaced with two wall-mounted sconces (emissive plate + OmniLight3D)
; on the back wall flanking the bed.
;
; Walls + floor are 10×12 m placeholder geometry matching Eli's Quarters
; (half_x = 5, half_z = 6).

